This repository is a multi-license aggregate.

Patched OptiScaler: GPL-3.0, licenses/OptiScaler-GPL-3.0.txt.
AIO add-on and caller bridge: Apache-2.0, licenses/AIO-Apache-2.0.txt and NOTICE.
New Heat helper and installer scripts: MIT, licenses/Heat-MIT.txt.
Feeder/MFG/ASI loader: their retained MIT licenses under licenses/.
MinHook and NVIDIA Optical Flow interface headers: retained original notices.

See THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md for component mappings. Proprietary NVIDIA
runtime libraries, models and ReShade binaries are not part of this package.
